# API Changelog 2.0 vs. 2.0


## API Changes

### PUT /items/{id}.json
-  added `subschema #1, subschema #2` to the `owner/status` request property `anyOf` list
-  the `owner/status` request property's min was unset from `2.00`
-  the `owner/status` request property `type` was widened from `integer` to `any`
-  the request required property `owner/status` became not write-only






